<title>USA: U.S. DLA sold 100 tonnes stockpile tin.</title>
<headline>U.S. DLA sold 100 tonnes stockpile tin.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense Logistics Agency said it sold 100 tonnes of stockpile tin at its daily offering Friday to two firms at a unit price of $2.7325 per lb.</p>
<p>DLA sold 80 tonnes of tin to American Iron &amp; Metal of Quebec, Canada and 20 tonnes to Hirsch Metals of Boca Raton, Fla.</p>
